"sourceId":"b2-075-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The only passengers, a young woman and her two baby daughters, were unhurt.","start":28.03,"end":34.96,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-004","sourceId":"b2-075-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was the middle of winter.","start":36.62,"end":38.15,"score":0.997,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-005","sourceId":"b2-075-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Snow lay thick on the ground.","start":38.84,"end":41.2,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-006","sourceId":"b2-075-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The woman knew that the nearest village was miles away.","start":42.69,"end":46.74,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-007-p01","sourceId":"b2-075-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When it grew dark, she turned a suitcase into a bed and put the children inside it,","start":48.14,"end":55.94,"score":0.978,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-007-p02","sourceId":"b2-075-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[17,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"covering them with all the clothes she could find.","start":56.46,"end":59.48,"score":0.978,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-008","sourceId":"b2-075-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"During the night, it got terribly cold.","start":60.89,"end":64.14,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-009-p01","sourceId":"b2-075-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The woman kept as near as she could to the children and even tried to get into the case herself,","start":65.62,"end":72.6,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-009-p02","sourceId":"b2-075-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[20,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"but it was too small.","start":73.36,"end":74.79,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-010","sourceId":"b2-075-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Early next morning, she heard planes passing overhead and wondered how she could send a signal.","start":76.3,"end":83.99,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-011","sourceId":"b2-075-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Then she had an idea.","start":85.28,"end":86.7,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-012","sourceId":"b2-075-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She stamped out the letters 'SOS' in the snow.","start":87.96,"end":93.63,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-013","sourceId":"b2-075-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Fortunately, a pilot saw the signal and sent a message by radio to the nearest town.","start":94.9,"end":101.79,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-075-014","sourceId":"b2-075-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was not long before a helicopter arrived on the scene to rescue the survivors of the plane crash.","start":102.9,"end":109.68,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
